Linus,

please pull sound fixes for v4.16-rc2 from:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound.git tags/sound-4.16-rc2

The topmost commit is fdcc968a3b290407bcba9d4c90e2fba6d8d928f1

----------------------------------------------------------------

sound fixes for 4.16-rc2

A collection of usual suspects:
- A handful USB-audio and HD-audio device-specific quirks
- Some trivial fixes for the new AC97 bus stuff
- Another race fix in ALSA sequencer core

----------------------------------------------------------------

Daniel Mack (1):
      ALSA: usb: add more device quirks for USB DSD devices

Hui Wang (1):
      ALSA: hda - Fix headset mic detection problem for two Dell machines

Jan-Marek Glogowski (1):
      ALSA: hda/realtek: PCI quirk for Fujitsu U7x7

Kailang Yang (2):
      ALSA: hda/realtek - Add headset mode support for Dell laptop
      ALSA: hda/realtek - Enable Thinkpad Dock device for ALC298 platform

Kirill Marinushkin (1):
      ALSA: usb-audio: Fix UAC2 get_ctl request with a RANGE attribute

Lassi Ylikojola (1):
      ALSA: usb-audio: add implicit fb quirk for Behringer UFX1204

Matthias Lange (1):
      ALSA: ac97: Fix copy and paste typo in documentation

Takashi Iwai (1):
      ALSA: seq: Fix racy pool initializations

Ulf Magnusson (1):
      ALSA: ac97: kconfig: Remove select of undefined symbol AC97

